==Trivia==
*The achievement name is a pun on the term "I can't do it".
*The achievement is the only one of the four requiring the player to defeat the boss at path level 4 without dying which is a grandmaster tier task; the other three equivalents, [[Rockin' around the croc]], [[Doesn't bug me]] and [[Ba-Bananza]] are master tier tasks.
**While [[All Praise Zebak]] is a grandmaster achievement which requires Rockin' around the croc, it additionally requires the player to lose no prayer points, something which Akkhan't Do it doesn't require.

